# Multi-Platform Workflow Automation Tool — Implementation Tasks

## Phase 0 — Foundation
- [ ] Initialize Node.js project (Fastify + TypeScript)
- [ ] Create `docker-compose.yml` (app, nocodb, postgres, nginx)
- [ ] Create `.env.example` with all required env variables
- [ ] Create `Dockerfile` for the app service
- [ ] Create NocoDB tables via MCP:
  - [ ] `Users` table
  - [ ] `Channel_Mapping` table
  - [ ] `Tasks` table
  - [ ] `Comments` table
  - [ ] `Event_Log` table
- [ ] Create NocoDB views

## Phase 1 — Task Sync (ClickUp → NocoDB + Threads)
- [ ] Implement ClickUp webhook handler (`POST /webhooks/clickup`)
- [ ] Implement webhook signature verification
- [ ] Implement event queue (pg-boss)
- [ ] Implement Task Sync Worker (ClickUp → NocoDB)
- [ ] Implement Channel Mapping lookup logic
- [ ] Implement Slack thread creation
- [ ] Implement Discord thread creation
- [ ] Implement NocoDB record update (Slack_TS, Discord_Thread_ID)

## Phase 2 — Comment Sync (Bi-directional)
- [ ] Implement Slack event handler for thread messages
- [ ] Implement Discord message handler for thread messages
- [ ] Implement ClickUp comment webhook handler
- [ ] Implement Comment Sync Worker (idempotency + broadcast)
- [ ] Implement anti-loop protection (bot marker)

## Phase 3 — Status Sync + Client Notification Gating
- [ ] Implement NocoDB webhook handler for status changes
- [ ] Implement ClickUp status update sync
- [ ] Implement Lead Review notification
- [ ] Implement Client Thread creation (dual-thread model)
- [ ] Implement client comment gating logic

## Phase 4 — Keyword & Reaction Automation
- [ ] Implement prefix commands (`!approved`, `!fix`, `!review`)
- [ ] Implement emoji reaction handlers
- [ ] Implement confirmation flow
- [ ] Implement role-based authorization

## Phase 5 — NocoDB Views & Dashboards
- [ ] Create Kanban Board view
- [ ] Create filtered views (My Tasks, Client Review, Overdue, etc.)
- [ ] Create Chart views

## Phase 6 — Weekly Reports
- [ ] Implement cron job scheduler
- [ ] Implement report data aggregation
- [ ] Implement Internal report (Slack + Discord)
- [ ] Implement Client report (filtered, Slack + Email)

## Phase 7 — Hardening
- [ ] Implement health check endpoint
- [ ] Implement comprehensive error handling
- [ ] Security audit (tokens, permissions, logging)
- [ ] Nginx configuration with SSL
